@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.29.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.29.0> ; owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.28.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.29.0 (2026-11-25): The lineage runs again after the urgency case. Before the chapter 17 page is built, the Owner's ruling of 2026-11-24 (no everyday analogies anywhere in the course materials) is taken in through change management: one change request, its impact assessment with measured facts, one scope change, and one story with three tasks for chapter 17. The chapter 17 page build now waits for it (re-ranked), so the page is built once, from the plain deck. Chapter 16 gets the same rule when its spec is written (its story already exists). Grooming comes before any build file."""@en .

ex:CR10_NoAnalogies a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "Chapters 17 and 16 carry plain explanations, not everyday analogies"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope10 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "Owner's ruling of 2026-11-24 (content, not a verbatim quotation): there are to be no everyday analogies anywhere in the course materials (decks, pages, chapter code, generators), because they mislead. Applied to chapters 10 and 11 in the urgency lineage on 2026-11-25. The ruling covers the whole course, so the two chapters of this lineage must meet it too, and the page of chapter 17 must not be built from a deck that still has them. The Owner's go-ahead of 2026-11-25 13:45 (OK, proceed) resumes this lineage; reading that go-ahead to include this ruling is my reading, stated here." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted .
ex:IA10_NoAnalogies a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Where the analogies are in chapter 17 today, measured before planning"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest ex:CR10_NoAnalogies ; backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage ex:Lineage10 ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "MEASURED FACTS (2026-11-25, read-only, from 08-tooling/ch17-deck/spec_v3_0_0/content_v3_0_0.py): the chapter 17 deck has 12 analogy slides titled Everyday pictures with 83 concept lines, a summary sentence that compares a summary to a packing list and a practice sentence that compares practice to finger scales; the notes file notes_v3_0_0.py has 28 lines with comparison wording to read. NOT YET MEASURED and stated: the chapter 17 lecture text and code source, and everything of chapter 16 (its deck is the old 1.0.0 file; its spec is not written, so it is written plain from the start). IMPACT: the slide count stays 59; the rule of the mission that content stays as approved is met with one stated exception, the analogy lines; the page of chapter 17 waits for the plain deck, which re-ranks TK10_Page_17_Build behind it." ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Decision made by me, not asked, because the Owner's own ruling and the lineage 11 precedent settle it: the analogy slides stay as slides (same count, titles of four words or more) and say plainly what each concept is and does, with the box label IN SHORT, as in chapters 10 and 11. The open question on the chapter 17 main-thread budget is not touched by this change." .
ex:SC10_NoAnalogies a backlog:ScopeChange ;
    rdfs:label "Scope grown by removing everyday analogies from chapters 17 and 16"@en ;
    backlog:fulfillsRequest ex:CR10_NoAnalogies ; backlog:changesScope ex:Scope10 ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:admitsItem ex:Area10_NoAnalogies, ex:Del10_NoAnalogies_17, ex:Del10_NoAnalogies_16 ;
    backlog:hasScopeChangeRationale "Owner's ruling of 2026-11-24 and go-ahead of 2026-11-25 13:45. One area and two deliverables added; the other chapters stay excluded." .
ex:Scope10 backlog:coversArea ex:Area10_NoAnalogies ; backlog:hasScopeDeliverable ex:Del10_NoAnalogies_17, ex:Del10_NoAnalogies_16 .
ex:Area10_NoAnalogies a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "No everyday analogies in chapters 17 and 16"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 .
ex:Del10_NoAnalogies_17 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 17 deck and page without everyday analogies, slide count unchanged"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area10_NoAnalogies .
ex:Del10_NoAnalogies_16 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 16 deck and page written without everyday analogies"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area10_NoAnalogies .

ex:AC10_NoAnalogies_17 a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The chapter 17 deck (59 slides), its notes, its lecture text and its code source contain no comparison with an everyday thing; the twelve former analogy slides keep titles of four words or more and state plainly what each concept is and does; deck checks, code check and a word search of all outputs pass and are logged."@en .
ex:ST10_NoAnalogies_17 a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Chapter 17: plain explanations instead of everyday analogies"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready ;
    backlog:appliesDefinitionOfDone ex:DoD10 ; backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC10_NoAnalogies_17 ;
    backlog:decomposesInto ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Content, ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Rebuild, ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Verify .
ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Content a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Write plain texts for the twelve slides, the summary and practice sentences, and the notes lines, as new content and notes versions"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Rebuild a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Build the chapter 17 deck in a new version from the new content"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Content .
ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Verify a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Run the deck checks and the code check, search all outputs for analogy wording, read the logs"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage10 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Verify ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Rebuild .
ex:Backlog10 backlog:hasBacklogMember ex:ST10_NoAnalogies_17 .

# Re-ranking: the page build waits for the plain deck.
ex:TK10_Page_17_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Verify ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Re-ranked on 2026-11-25 (change request CR10_NoAnalogies): the page is built once, from the deck without analogies, so it now waits for TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Verify; it was Ready before." .
